MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_001: Rest in peace, if you lot can.
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_002: Praying? What for? Calm seas?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_003: Not that. It's a memorial. For all the people I killed.\nAll those merchants... All those ships...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_004: Whoa! You have enough of a heart left to repent. I'm\nactually impressed!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_005: Repent? No, not that... It's the ghosts! They're\ncoming for me!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_006: Wait. What?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_007: I've always been frightened of ghosts... Since I was\na tyke.
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_008: And now I can see 'em! The dead! This is all that\nbastard Talimun's fault!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_009: When he tossed me in the sea, I almost drowned!\nAnd then it began...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_010: Whyyy is this happening to meee? *sob*
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_011: Don't cry like that... You sound like a lost sea beast!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_012: I killed 'em the same way—tossed 'em overboard.\nThat's why they bear me a grudge!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_013: All I can do now is give up my evil ways and pray!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_014: Are you sure you're seeing ghosts? Like, really seeing\nreal ghosts?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_015: Yes, I damn well am! Countless hands...grasping at\nme from the black depths...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_016: Not just the sea! On land too! Times like this, with\na damp, salty breeze—I see them reaching!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_017: A wind like this one, you say?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_018: Out of nowhere...a voice begins to speak...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_019: You... Come to me...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_020: Eek! That's not funny! How did you change your\nvoice? Cut it out!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_021: It wasn't me! I thought it was you!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_022: It wasn't me! Wait a minute. Does that mean it's\nreally a ghost?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_023: Eeyaaaaaah!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_024: Yaaagh! Stay back! Nooo!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_025: Come on out, you ghost! I'm not scared! I'll bop you\nin your ghosty face!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_026: Wait...this is a sea beast! Hahaha. Just a\nstupid sea beast! On your feet, Kiroc!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_027: Gh-ghost? Where's the ghost? Is it here?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_028: It's not a ghost, you dunderhead. It's a sea beast!\nYou know, swimmy swimmy? Calm down!
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_029: Oh, so that's all it was. Whew! What a relief.\nHehe... Hehehe...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_030: Thing is... I grew up hearing their calls all the time.\nIt's strange for me to make that mistake...
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_031: Shut up! It was a sea beast! You said it yourself!\nSwimmy swimmy! That's what she said, right?
MID_SE_Esm_Kir_C_032: Um, who are you talking to? There's...nobody there.\nHeh... I gotta go.